ون 16‏:31‏-34.‏‏","reference":{"chapter":19,"verse":7}},{"noteId":27,"caller":"+","text":"لە زمانی عیبری بە واتای خوێنگر دێت، بۆ تێگەیشتن لەم دەربڕینە بڕوانە ڕائووس 4‏‏.‏","reference":{"chapter":19,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ckb_bib/PSA/19.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ckb_bib/PSA/20.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ckb_bib/PSA/18.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}